ties are populated while replacements are absent, asserting defaults (or, for Spring, default MDC names).","downsides":"Tests only; not executed locally (JDK < 21).","findings":["inline:4210916582","inline:4210916671","inline:4210916730","review:5447098471"],"length":9762,"offset":0,"sha256":"8e50e3e1647eba1442d93e417bf7d9c4483bec778f6041b9585f99bda70fc366","summary":"Test that removed legacy logging keys are ignored","upsides":"Prevents the 3.0 legacy fallbacks from being silently reintroduced."}],"findings":[{"analysis":"Summary body lists the three inline findings; all were valid and addressed.","disposition":"fixed","downsides":"None significant.","key":"review:5447098471","upsides":"Complete coverage of the legacy removal."},{"analysis":"Warranted: the tests no longer exercised the removed legacy paths. Adds regression coverage: legacy keys/properties are populated while replacements are absent, asserting defaults (or, for Spring, default MDC names).","disposition":"fixed","downsides":"Slightly larger tests.","key":"inline:4210916582","upsides":"Guards the breaking behavior."},{"analysis":"Warranted: the tests no longer exercised the removed legacy paths. Adds regression coverage: legacy keys/properties are populated while replacements are absent, asserting defaults (or, for Spring, default MDC names).","disposition":"fixed","downsides":"Slightly larger tests.","key":"inline:4210916671","upsides":"Guards the breaking behavior."},{"analysis":"Warranted: the tests no longer exercised the removed legacy paths. Adds regression coverage: legacy keys/properties are populated while replacements are absent, asserting defaults (or, for Spring, default MDC names).","disposition":"fixed","downsides":"Slightly larger tests.","key":"inline:4210916730","upsides":"Guards the breaking behavior."}],"outcome":"fixes","request_digest":"9867695d5435aff3b072290b0533f92465d272cc45347211633aa5b357d41fd5","schema":2},"download_sha256":"257b43df0578233be7aea2c29ca18e9fb74085b09391c9fdcaa9afee7089bba5","frozen_sha":"bb3ca8ab7c08beb47553035384fb702a1df9d94f","pr":20417,"publication_eligible":false,"repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","request_digest":"9867695d5435aff3b072290b0533f92465d272cc45347211633aa5b357d41fd5","request_id":"17fcd985c285416c854fd978ab1e852a","run_attempt":1,"run_id":37680740532,"schema":2,"scope":"Structural/Git verification only. No target code or tests are executed.","server_artifact_digest":"sha256:257b43df0578233be7aea2c29ca18e9fb74085b09391c9fdcaa9afee7089bba5","verification":"verified","verification_run":{"attempt":1,"id":37683451020},"workflow_revision":"f760a5dabf752f3e5aa268f6ce28eeb5714afe07"},"request":{"authorized_actor_id":218610,"baseline_review_ids":[5437474049,5437837499,5441128954,5441142962,5441145344,5447098471],"budgets":{"deadline_seconds":7200,"max_iterations":5,"propagation_seconds":120,"retention_days":14,"worker_timeout_minutes":30},"commit_author":{"id":218610,"login":"trask"},"deadline":1791411336,"findings":[{"body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### \ud83d\udfe1 Changes recommended\n\nThe legacy-key removal paths need regression coverage proving deprecated declarative and flat properties are ignored.\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>3 open findings</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Low severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Verify legacy trace keys do not affect ContextDataKeys](#discussion_r4210916582) \u00b7 New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Low severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Add regression coverage proving legacy configuration is ignored](#discussion_r4210916671) \u00b7 New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Low severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Test Spring starter ignores legacy MDC properties](#discussion_r4210916730) \u00b7 New\n</details>\n\n\ud83e\udde0 **Review effort:** Balanced","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5447098471","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5447098471},{"body":"[Testing] This rewrite no longer supplies any of the removed `trace_id`, `span_id`, or `trace_flags` keys, so it would still pass if the legacy fallback were accidentally restored. Since ignoring those keys is the breaking behavior in this PR, add a case that populates the legacy declarative keys and verifies all three getters retain their defaults (or use the replacement values).","comment_commit_id":"bb3ca8ab7c08beb47553035384fb702a1df9d94f","comment_id":4210916582,"key":"inline:4210916582","kind":"inline","line":24,"original_commit_id":"bb3ca8ab7c08beb47553035384fb702a1df9d94f","original_line":24,"path":"instrumentation-api-incubator/src/test/java/io/opentelemetry/instrumentation/api/incubator/config/internal/CommonConfigTest.java","review_commit_id":"bb3ca8ab7c08beb47553035384fb702a1df9d94f","re